  "claim_scope": "The original StockTarget source compiler now directly consumes actual frame.action. Its paid branch retains the original answered face/consumer and canonical native-write mathNext; its actual settled branch emits the existing Shared debt-admission target restricted by Observation.Material.target to the original complete StockObservation root at the same event. The target root/current, original receipt/firstSuccessor/old-born rows, both inventory callbacks and generated-living-law successor preservation are directly consumed. The old StockAdmission section and public API types remain compatible, and all six affected sources plus the new gate and original CP102 direct gate are independently rebuilt. This restores source compiler branches; it does not assert the existing SourceFamily.runtime activation already traverses the restored branch or identifies sealed activation histories.",
