    "The candidate Admission main OLean is byte-identical to the frozen construction export after the independent formal dependency installation. All13 new examples and27 original CP102 example bodies are independently kernel checked in private header-only/namespaced clones. The2 old Type-valued cofinal controls remain definitions, preserving their data-valued witness scope.",
    "The entire original StockAdmission source section is byte-identical. Original StockTarget face/consumer prefix, compilation/state/presentation type headers, and imports are byte-identical. All30 selected original API type expressions are structurally identical modulo bound-variable names, with identical universe parameters.25 raw expressions are identical;5 differ solely in hygienic implicit-binder numbering.",
