    "compilation matches the original actual frame.action. inr emits the old answered semantic face and consumer; inl emits debtAdmission from the existing source target program. The installed compilationFace and U7 audit commutation inspect that same actual branch. They introduce no new root/controller/next gate.",
    "The paid successor proof consumes active_directlyAnswered_successor_valid and generatedNextCurrentAt_eq_nativeWriteBranch, retaining actual mathNext. The settled proof consumes active_debtAdmission_successor_valid and the generated target_root/current equalities, retaining actual nextBorn and complete StockObservation root.",
