    "The new gate also consumes unchanged StockAdmission.compiles/target_current and existing Shared receipt_compiles/receipt_next. The original CP102 full R pair, complete writtenborn/new Packet, fresh second source decoder and own fixed-programme cofinal controls all continue to pass under the restored branch.",
